{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spanky &quot;Bat-a-Swing&quot; is a 3D rhythm based platformer, inspired by 1930s cartoons and featuring electro swing music! Enter and explore Metronopolis, a huge city where everything and everyone moves and dances on the beat of music! Help Spanky the Bat reach Mayor Metrognome's office and restore peace for your bat ears!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337560/extras/1c8eb53a853c6ca335bead14bb3128d6.poster.avif?t=1770490703\" width=600 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337560/extras/1c8eb53a853c6ca335bead14bb3128d6.webm?t=1770490703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337560/extras/1c8eb53a853c6ca335bead14bb3128d6.mp4?t=1770490703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BEAT-BLASTED ACTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Spanky &quot;Bat-a-Swing&quot;</strong>, the whole world shimmies to the soundtrack. The music isn\u2019t background\u2014it\u2019s the <strong>metronome of the metropolis</strong>. Enemies lunge on the downbeat, platforms hop on the upbeat, traps snap in perfect time. The only rebel off-tempo? <strong>Spanky</strong>. Swing, slam, and slide\u2014ride the rhythm or break it to pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337560/extras/e475e9a7f25c3e99b120caee277bb2e1.poster.avif?t=1770490703\" width=600 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337560/extras/e475e9a7f25c3e99b120caee277bb2e1.webm?t=1770490703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337560/extras/e475e9a7f25c3e99b120caee277bb2e1.mp4?t=1770490703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ONE OF US</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sick of Metronopolis\u2019s endless noise, <strong>Spanky the bat</strong> straps on <strong>giant speakers</strong> and sets out to quiet <strong>Mayor Metrognome</strong> for good. Turn the city\u2019s sound against itself: boost with bass, bounce off snare hits, glide on horns, and ping secrets with <strong>bat sonar</strong>. It\u2019s spanking time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337560/extras/82d6269f30343e96a847977984d3500e.poster.avif?t=1770490703\" width=600 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337560/extras/82d6269f30343e96a847977984d3500e.webm?t=1770490703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337560/extras/82d6269f30343e96a847977984d3500e.mp4?t=1770490703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE CITY OF METRONOPOLIS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw down with towering bosses and cut a path through bold, hand-drawn districts\u2014each with its own groove, guardian, and tricks to master. Discover powers, learn fresh moves, and meet a cast of weirdos and wannabe stars along the way. Who\u2019s on your wavelength?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rhythm-Driven Platforming:</strong> Every foe, platform, and hazard moves to the beat\u2014learn the pattern, bend the pattern, <strong>own</strong> the pattern.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Electro-Swing Soundtrack:</strong> A punchy, dynamic score that keeps the city buzzing and your feet tapping.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vintage Cartoon Flair:</strong> A lively, personality-packed world with expressive characters and a 1930s-inspired look.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rebel Against the Beat:</strong> As Spanky, you can sync up\u2026 or go off-grid. Break timing rules to create your own openings and shut the city up\u2014your way.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2337560?t=1770490703","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337560/d1a05cb1ff15b8cf20ea8476ddccfb0042a5d9a1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770490703","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337560/5e3a814ba0a5ca049687067312f1b2d7bbcd7e4a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770490703","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337560/5e3a814ba0a5ca049687067312f1b2d7bbcd7e4a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770490703","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4134890,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spanky &quot;Bat-a-Swing&quot; is a 3D rhythm based platformer, inspired by 1930s cartoons and featuring electro swing music! Enter and explore Metronopolis, a huge city where everything and everyone moves and dances on the beat of music! Help Spanky the Bat reach Mayor Metrognome's office and restore peace for your bat ears!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=