unce off snare hits, glide on horns, and ping secrets with <strong>bat sonar</strong>. It\u2019s spanking time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337560/extras/82d6269f30343e96a847977984d3500e.poster.avif?t=1770490703\" width=600 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337560/extras/82d6269f30343e96a847977984d3500e.webm?t=1770490703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2337560/extras/82d6269f30343e96a847977984d3500e.mp4?t=1770490703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE CITY OF METRONOPOLIS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw down with towering bosses and cut a path through bold, hand-drawn districts\u2014each with its own groove, guardian, and tricks to master. Discover powers, learn fresh moves, and meet a cast of weirdos and wannabe stars along the way. Who\u2019s on your wavelength?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rhythm-Driven Platforming:</strong> Every foe, platform, and hazard moves to the beat\u2014learn the pattern, bend the pattern, <strong>own</strong> the pattern.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Electro-Swing Soundtrack:</strong> A punchy, dynamic score that keeps the city buzzing and your feet tapping.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vintage Cartoon Flair:</strong> A lively, personality-packed world with expressive characters and a 1930s-inspired look.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rebel Against the Beat:</strong> As Spanky, you can sync up\u2026 or go off-grid. Break timing rules to create your own openings and shut the city up\u2014your way.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Green Flamingo"],"gen